# VALIDATION - CREATE

###############################################################

### Invalid Internship Data

POST {{apiUrl}}/internships
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"studentId": "",
"hteId": ""
}

###

### Expected:

### HTTP 400

### Validation error

###############################################################

### Missing Required Internship Fields

POST {{apiUrl}}/internships
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"studentId": "{{studentId}}"
}

###

### Expected:

### HTTP 400

### Validation error

