POST {{apiUrl}}/internships
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"studentId": "{{studentId}}",
"hteId": "not-a-uuid"
}

###

### Expected:

### HTTP 400

### Validation error

